<details>
<summary><b>Severity Level:</b> Major ⚠️</summary>

```mdx
- ⚠️ Local shell rm -rf leaves orphaned filesystem entries.
- ⚠️ Inconsistent behavior between ls output and file access.
- ⚠️ Confuses users and agents relying on directory cleanup.
```
</details>

```suggestion
        case 'rm': {
          if (!arg1) {
            writeError('rm: missing operand');
