comments.content:
**Suggestion:** The sandbox connect button (`toggleSandboxConnection`) issues its own POST to `/api/sandbox/terminal` and then calls `connectTerminal`, which also POSTs to the same endpoint, so a single click provisions two sandbox sessions while only one is ever used; this leaks sandbox resources and can hit backend quotas unnecessarily. Remove the redundant POST and delegate session provisioning entirely to `connectTerminal` while keeping the button's status and toast behavior. [resource leak]

<details>
<summary><b>Severity Level:</b> Major ⚠️</summary>

```mdx
- ⚠️ Sandbox connect button provisions duplicate unused terminal sessions.
- ⚠️ Backend sandbox quotas are exhausted faster under usage.
```
</details>

```suggestion
  const toggleSandboxConnection = useCallback(async () => {
    if (sandboxStatus === 'connected') {
      // Disconnect - kill sandbox session
      const term = terminalsRef.current.find(t => t.id === activeTerminalId);
      if (term?.sandboxInfo.sessionId) {
        try {
          await fetch('/api/sandbox/terminal', {
            method: 'DELETE',
            headers: {
              'Content-Type': 'application/json',
              ...getAuthHeaders(),
            },
            body: JSON.stringify({ sessionId: term.sandboxInfo.sessionId }),
          });
          setSandboxStatus('disconnected');
          toast.success('Sandbox disconnected');
        } catch (error) {
          toast.error('Failed to disconnect sandbox');
        }
      }
    } else if (sandboxStatus === 'disconnected') {
      // Connect - delegate sandbox provisioning to connectTerminal
      setSandboxStatus('connecting');
      try {
        if (activeTerminalId) {
          await connectTerminal(activeTerminalId);
          setSandboxStatus('connected');
          toast.success('Sandbox connected');
        } else {
          toast.error('No active terminal to connect');
          setSandboxStatus('disconnected');
        }
      } catch (error) {
        toast.error('Failed to connect sandbox');
        setSandboxStatus('disconnected');
      }
    }
  }, [sandboxStatus, activeTerminalId, connectTerminal]);
```
